</div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Plenary presentation to SIAM CSE19]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">MOM6 Testing</title><link href="https://adcroft.github.io/2017/04/25/MOM6-testing.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="MOM6 Testing" /><published>2017-04-25T00:00:00-04:00</published><updated>2017-04-25T00:00:00-04:00</updated><id>https://adcroft.github.io/2017/04/25/MOM6-testing</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://adcroft.github.io/2017/04/25/MOM6-testing.html"><![CDATA[<p>These slides were created as a high-level overview of how and where we do testing of MOM6.
