</div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Presentation at NCAR tutorial session on MOM6]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">MOM6 ALE algorithm</title><link href="https://adcroft.github.io/2017/03/01/MOM6-ALE-algorithm.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="MOM6 ALE algorithm" /><published>2017-03-01T00:00:00-05:00</published><updated>2017-03-01T00:00:00-05:00</updated><id>https://adcroft.github.io/2017/03/01/MOM6-ALE-algorithm</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://adcroft.github.io/2017/03/01/MOM6-ALE-algorithm.html"><![CDATA[<p>This is a brief overview of how the ALE algorithm works in MOM6. First presented to NCAR CGD at a MOM6 tutorial, March 2017.</p>

