</div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Presentation at NCAR tutorial session on MOM6]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Overview of MOM6</title><link href="https://adcroft.github.io/2017/02/28/MOM6-overview.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Overview of MOM6" /><published>2017-02-28T00:00:00-05:00</published><updated>2017-02-28T00:00:00-05:00</updated><id>https://adcroft.github.io/2017/02/28/MOM6-overview</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://adcroft.github.io/2017/02/28/MOM6-overview.html"><![CDATA[<p>This overview of MOM6 was given to the CESM ocean model working group at the 2017 Winter meeting.</p>

